      "updated_at": "2026-08-02T11:14:34Z",
      "body": "Confirmed compatibility report submitted: https://github.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/pull/7\n\n- **Status:** menus\n- **Release:** v0.1.6\n- **Device:** OnePlus 13 · Snapdragon 8 Elite (Adreno 830, Android 16)\n- **Driver:** Mesa Turnip 26.2.0-devel (git-7fdde2f8f8, gen8-v2, APK-bundled)\n- **Evidence commit:** `be854b75d3aa3549fe0f098bb98a3674b4daa279`\n\nBoots into the title screen (\"PRESS ╳ TO BEGIN\") and holds it at ~30 FPS (60 samples, avg 26.7 / min 13.9 / max 30.1). The on-screen X button did not advance into the main menu or gameplay. Persistent horizontal banding corruption is visible on the background sky. One longer run also crashed mid-loading with a shadPS4 GfxFlip assertion (exitCode 133).\n\n### Screenshots\n\n![Crash Bandicoot N. Sane Trilogy — v0.1.6 — menus](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/be854b75d3aa3549fe0f098bb98a3674b4daa279/assets/CUSA07399/20260802T103831Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-mesa-turnip-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/01.webp)\n\n![Crash Bandicoot N. Sane Trilogy — v0.1.6 — menus](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/be854b75d3aa3549fe0f098bb98a3674b4daa279/assets/CUSA07399/20260802T103831Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-mesa-turnip-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/02.webp)\n\n![Crash Bandicoot N. Sane Trilogy — v0.1.6 — menus](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/be854b75d3aa3549fe0f098bb98a3674b4daa279/assets/CUSA07399/20260802T103831Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-mesa-turnip-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/03.webp)\n",
      "author_association": "OWNER",
